  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "鼠王先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "唔，是你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "他們怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我說過，這座城市不需要流血，他們要是能逃得出去，就讓他們逃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "懷念舊主是好事，你們用自己的效忠換來了其他同伴生存的權利，說明你們尚存良知，但千萬不要奢求更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "......是、是的。但是後來的事情，已經明顯僭越了龍門的規矩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你們學的倒是挺快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "聽說，遠在敘拉古成為今天的模樣之前，那時還必須苟且為生的黑手黨之間，流傳著一些默認的法則。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "人人遵循，人人默許，在波濤洶湧的時局之中，黑手黨反倒成為了最守信用的團體。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "他們販賣人情，四處兜售戰爭，最終走到了今天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "龍門有龍門的律憲，我有我的規矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "企鵝物流也有他們自己那一套為所欲為的法則，只不過各不相同罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "鼠王先生，如果當時首領......甘比諾先生不在第一次見面的時候拔劍的話，事情會演變到這一步嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我給過機會，在那之前之後，遠不止那一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "但有些時候，特別是談生意的場合，第一印象是非常重要的，明白嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "......明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "......呼，呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "出口......在那......！就快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "——誰！？出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "原來你沒死，真是意外，看來鼠王辦事也並非那麼徹底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "......被你刺傷的傷口還隱隱作痛，卡彭，我非常高興你會主動出現在我的面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "好讓我親手殺了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "整個龍門都在追捕我們。我不想浪費時間在你身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "所以，速戰速決吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "你會為背叛家族付出代價——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哈哈，家族，家族呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "真是讓人懷念的說法，嗯，你們見到德克薩斯了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "這、這個氣味......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "......落單的狼。你為什麼會在龍門？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "因為德克薩斯在這裡，這不是顯而易見的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "話說，原來拖家帶口地逃離敘拉古還能有資格自稱家族？還有資格自稱“西西里人”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "那麼那位掠奪了你們引以為傲的榮光和歷史的......西西里女士本人，同意了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "——住嘴！不要在我面前提起那個女人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "你只是一個叛徒，你沒資格對我們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "閉嘴，廢物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "啊，原來你們受傷了？熟悉的血腥味，狼血，嗯，這就是所謂的家鄉的味道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "德克薩斯變了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "她真的變得太多太多了，敘拉古的老朋友找上門來，而她居然讓你們活著離開了龍門？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "這也太不講究待客之道了，不可能的吧？但是沒關係，她沒有做的事情，我會來幫她善後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "也許把敘拉古同僚的屍首擺在她的面前，能稍微刺激到她一點，是呢，真是個好主意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "你們覺得她逃得掉嗎？從她家族的陰影裡，從那段過去裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "......卡彭，給我站穩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "呵，你竟然會和我並肩作戰？你的榮耀和家族呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "念在你避開了要害的份上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "哼，你在害怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "我唯獨不願死在她的手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "......有點道理，就算要死，我也希望留下一具全屍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，你們都在發抖哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "站都站不穩了還想要和我戰鬥嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "不錯，真不錯，親眼目睹垂死掙扎也是不錯的消遣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "現在，給你們十秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "text": "逃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
